00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Can ten specialist autoencoders beat one unified model?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,500
Three seeds, 63 neural fits, paired errors, and a total-parameter control.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:14,500
